<title>NEW ZEALAND: Foreigners hold 61.4 pct of NZ govt securities.</title>
<headline>Foreigners hold 61.4 pct of NZ govt securities.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The proportion of New Zealand government securities held by foreigners rose in March to 61.4 percent from 57.2 percent in February, the Reserve Bank said on Friday.  </p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
